            "review_text": "moonlotus18\nHamilton, New Zealand2312 contributions\n0\nDelicious kebab but inconsistent quantity\nApr 2017 • Family\nWe came by this place three times during our stay at Hanoi and loved their kebab. But we found that the quantity of meat given varies. On our last visit, we saw a local women standing next to the person preparing the kebab giving him instructions to give her more meat. We did the same when our turn came and found they did give a bit more meat when under scrutiny and specifically instructed without charging extra.\nGreat value for money but be wise.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 18, 2017",
